      "accordion_parsys7": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "accPosId": 7,
        "cols2_2_3_1_3": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-5b105250fc@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-5b105250fc@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Oct 24 2017 14:49:53 GMT-0400",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Oct 24 2017 14:49:53 GMT-0400",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/columncontrol/cols2_2-3_1-3",
          "col1": {
            "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
            "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
            "text": {
              "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
              "jcr:createdBy": "user-5b105250fc@example.invalid",
              "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-5b105250fc@example.invalid",
              "jcr:created": "Tue Oct 24 2017 14:50:01 GMT-0400",
              "text": "<p>Non-clinical testing and analysis has demonstrated that the Wingspan® Stent is MR Conditional alone, or when overlapped with a second stent. A patient with this device can be safely scanned immediately after placement of this implant,&nbsp;in an MR system meeting the following conditions:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Static magnetic field of&nbsp; 1.5T and 3.0T only&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Maximum spatial gradient magnetic field of 2,500 gauss/cm (25 T/m) or less</li>\n<li>Maximum MR system reported, whole body averaged specific absorption rate (SAR) of 2 W/kg (Normal Operating Mode) and head averaged SAR of 3.2 W/kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Under the scan conditions defined above, the Wingspan Stent is expected to produce a maximum temperature rise of 4ºC after 15 minutes of continuous scanning. &nbsp;</p>\n<p>In non-clinical testing, the image artifact caused by the device extends up to 2 mm from the Wingspan stent when imaged with a spin echo pulse sequence and a 3 Tesla MRI system.&nbsp; The artifact may obscure the device lumen.</p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Oct 24 2017 15:10:17 GMT-0400",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
              "textIsRich": "true"
            }
          }
        },
